    "short_sha": "ba8b80e",
    "message": "Merge pull request #1890 from ZalithLauncher/fix/sdl-dlsym-proxy\n\nfix: 新增 SDL dlsym 层代理，销毁门控覆盖复用窗口",
    "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:28:43Z",
